# Astro config + content config

- **`astro.config.mjs`:** Sets `site`, Vite Tailwind plugin, `markdown` / `shikiConfig`, and integrations (`sitemap`, `mdx`). Changing `site` affects absolute URLs (sitemap, RSS `context.site`, SEO).
- **`src/content.config.ts`:** Defines loaders and Zod schemas for all collections; changing a schema requires updating markdown files and every importer under `src/pages` and `src/layouts` that uses `entry.data`.
- Edit both files together only when the linking is real (e.g. new integration, or content layer changes that depend on `site` / image pipeline). Avoid unrelated edits when touching one file.
